<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>TIAFLIX | Em breve</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            height: 100vh;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #000000, #1a1a1a);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 48px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #e50914;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #cccccc;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .loader {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            border: 6px solid #333;
            border-top: 6px solid #e50914;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">TIAFLIX</div>
        <h1>Estaremos de volta em breve</h1>
        <p>Estamos trabalhando para trazer a melhor experiência para você.</p>
        <div class="loader"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
